{"id":"forecast-05","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-05/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":379.36,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":5.0,"text":"Part 3 You will hear two music students discussing the","words":[["Part",0.0,0.44],["3",0.44,0.86],["You",0.86,2.48],["will",2.48,2.66],["hear",2.66,2.92],["two",2.92,3.26],["music",3.26,3.72],["students",3.72,4.14],["discussing",4.14,4.66],["the",4.66,5.0]]},{"start":5.0,"end":11.88,"text":"results of a survey they have done. First, you have some time to look at questions 21 to 26.","words":[["results",5.0,5.38],["of",5.38,5.62],["a",5.62,5.76],["survey",5.76,6.12],["they",6.12,6.42],["have",6.42,6.58],["done.",6.58,6.88],["First,",7.82,8.48],["you",8.66,8.7],["have",8.7,8.86],["some",8.86,9.02],["time",9.02,9.38],["to",9.38,9.64],["look",9.64,9.76],["at",9.76,9.92],["questions",9.92,10.2],["21",10.2,11.04],["to",11.04,11.3],["26.",11.3,11.88]]},{"start":42.34,"end":46.58,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["Now",42.34,42.82],["listen",42.82,43.16],["carefully",43.16,43.64],["and",43.64,44.02],["answer",44.02,44.44],["questions",44.44,44.86],["21",44.86,45.72],["to",45.72,45.98],["26.",45.98,46.58]]},{"start":50.1,"end":55.46,"text":"So, Gareth, we need to organize the findings from our survey or music students for the final","words":[["So,",50.1,50.54],["Gareth,",50.78,50.92],["we",51.24,51.42],["need",51.42,51.62],["to",51.62,51.8],["organize",51.8,52.16],["the",52.16,52.42],["findings",52.42,52.82],["from",52.82,53.16],["our",53.16,53.32],["survey",53.32,53.7],["or",53.7,53.9],["music",53.9,54.24],["students",54.24,54.74],["for",54.74,55.02],["the",55.02,55.14],["final",55.14,55.46]]},{"start":55.46,"end":61.02,"text":"presentation. Yes, Launa, I think we've got some very interesting results. Obviously,","words":[["presentation.",55.46,56.1],["Yes,",56.5,56.82],["Launa,",57.02,57.14],["I",57.66,57.84],["think",57.84,57.94],["we've",57.94,58.14],["got",58.14,58.26],["some",58.26,58.44],["very",58.44,58.7],["interesting",58.7,59.2],["results.",59.2,59.72],["Obviously,",60.6,61.02]]},{"start":61.02,"end":64.88,"text":"Firstly, we need to start by saying that we interviewed all the third year students doing","words":[["Firstly,",61.02,61.14],["we",61.2,61.3],["need",61.3,61.4],["to",61.4,61.54],["start",61.54,61.8],["by",61.8,62.02],["saying",62.02,62.3],["that",62.3,62.5],["we",62.5,62.6],["interviewed",62.6,63.1],["all",63.1,63.36],["the",63.36,63.54],["third",63.54,63.76],["year",63.76,64.0],["students",64.0,64.4],["doing",64.4,64.88]]},{"start":64.88,"end":70.06,"text":"a music degree and state the objective of our research project, that is, to find out","words":[["a",64.88,65.1],["music",65.1,65.36],["degree",65.36,65.76],["and",65.76,66.46],["state",66.46,66.72],["the",66.72,66.9],["objective",66.9,67.34],["of",67.34,67.6],["our",67.6,67.74],["research",67.74,68.12],["project,",68.12,68.66],["that",68.96,69.2],["is,",69.2,69.42],["to",69.54,69.66],["find",69.66,69.86],["out",69.86,70.06]]},{"start":70.06,"end":71.78,"text":"about their attitudes to performing.","words":[["about",70.06,70.3],["their",70.3,70.5],["attitudes",70.5,71.02],["to",71.02,71.34],["performing.",71.34,71.78]]},{"start":72.32,"end":76.9,"text":"And then we should talk about the students' musical backgrounds before coming to university.","words":[["And",72.32,72.6],["then",72.6,72.78],["we",72.78,72.96],["should",72.96,73.1],["talk",73.1,73.28],["about",73.28,73.52],["the",73.52,73.66],["students'",73.66,73.94],["musical",74.2,74.56],["backgrounds",74.56,75.16],["before",75.16,75.78],["coming",75.78,76.14],["to",76.14,76.32],["university.",76.32,76.9]]},{"start":77.64,"end":81.92,"text":"The most important points to make are that although most people have actually composed","words":[["The",77.64,77.82],["most",77.82,78.04],["important",78.04,78.52],["points",78.52,78.96],["to",78.96,79.2],["make",79.2,79.5],["are",79.5,79.84],["that",79.84,79.96],["although",79.96,80.38],["most",80.38,80.72],["people",80.72,81.06],["have",81.06,81.2],["actually",81.2,81.54],["composed",81.54,81.92]]},{"start":81.92,"end":87.28,"text":"music during the course, that wasn't the case when they arrived. And the other thing","words":[["music",81.92,82.56],["during",82.56,82.88],["the",82.88,83.1],["course,",83.1,83.48],["that",83.94,84.06],["wasn't",84.06,84.5],["the",84.5,84.62],["case",84.62,84.86],["when",84.86,85.0],["they",85.0,85.16],["arrived.",85.16,85.6],["And",86.34,86.66],["the",86.66,86.84],["other",86.84,87.04],["thing",87.04,87.28]]},{"start":87.28,"end":88.82,"text":"they had in common was the piano.","words":[["they",87.28,87.46],["had",87.46,87.66],["in",87.66,87.82],["common",87.82,88.1],["was",88.1,88.36],["the",88.36,88.52],["piano.",88.52,88.82]]},{"start":88.82,"end":94.44,"text":"Well, they'd had access to a piano at some point, but not all had studied it formally.","words":[["Well,",88.82,89.64],["they'd",89.88,90.16],["had",90.16,90.3],["access",90.3,90.72],["to",90.72,90.98],["a",90.98,91.1],["piano",91.1,91.34],["at",91.34,91.56],["some",91.56,91.8],["point,",91.8,92.2],["but",92.5,92.8],["not",92.8,92.94],["all",92.94,93.24],["had",93.24,93.48],["studied",93.48,93.84],["it",93.84,94.06],["formally.",94.06,94.44]]},{"start":95.32,"end":100.2,"text":"I thought the most interesting finding was that before coming here, almost everyone was","words":[["I",95.32,95.62],["thought",95.62,95.76],["the",95.76,95.88],["most",95.88,96.04],["interesting",96.04,96.66],["finding",96.66,97.16],["was",97.16,97.46],["that",97.46,97.62],["before",97.62,97.9],["coming",97.9,98.3],["here,",98.3,98.68],["almost",99.06,99.36],["everyone",99.36,99.92],["was",99.92,100.2]]},{"start":100.2,"end":105.48,"text":"involved in a chamber orchestra or band or singing in a choir and playing in front of","words":[["involved",100.2,100.56],["in",100.56,100.82],["a",100.82,100.96],["chamber",100.96,101.36],["orchestra",101.36,101.82],["or",101.82,102.28],["band",102.28,102.72],["or",102.72,103.34],["singing",103.34,103.7],["in",103.7,103.94],["a",103.94,104.04],["choir",104.04,104.34],["and",104.34,104.64],["playing",104.64,104.88],["in",104.88,105.12],["front",105.12,105.28],["of",105.28,105.48]]},{"start":105.48,"end":106.44,"text":"live audiences.","words":[["live",105.48,105.78],["audiences.",105.78,106.44]]},{"start":106.9,"end":109.02,"text":"But varying enormously in size.","words":[["But",106.9,107.2],["varying",107.2,107.76],["enormously",107.76,108.4],["in",108.4,108.7],["size.",108.7,109.02]]},{"start":109.7,"end":111.68,"text":"Some had only played in tiny venues.","words":[["Some",109.7,110.08],["had",110.08,110.24],["only",110.24,110.44],["played",110.44,110.68],["in",110.68,110.88],["tiny",110.88,111.26],["venues.",111.26,111.68]]},{"start":112.3,"end":113.88,"text":"I think it's worth saying that.","words":[["I",112.3,112.6],["think",112.6,112.78],["it's",112.78,112.98],["worth",112.98,113.2],["saying",113.2,113.52],["that.",113.52,113.88]]},{"start":114.16,"end":114.38,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",114.16,114.38]]},{"start":114.38,"end":120.74,"text":"And as you might expect from people wanting to study music, they all had a degree of proficiency","words":[["And",114.38,115.42],["as",115.42,115.64],["you",115.64,115.76],["might",115.76,115.9],["expect",115.9,116.36],["from",116.36,116.68],["people",116.68,116.98],["wanting",116.98,117.32],["to",117.32,117.56],["study",117.56,117.86],["music,",117.86,118.32],["they",118.88,119.1],["all",119.1,119.32],["had",119.32,119.6],["a",119.6,119.7],["degree",119.7,120.0],["of",120.0,120.2],["proficiency",120.2,120.74]]},{"start":120.74,"end":126.12,"text":"in at least two instruments. But in most cases, one of the instruments was dominant.","words":[["in",120.74,121.22],["at",121.22,121.34],["least",121.34,121.56],["two",121.56,122.02],["instruments.",122.02,122.62],["But",123.24,123.48],["in",123.48,123.58],["most",123.58,123.8],["cases,",123.8,124.3],["one",124.52,124.76],["of",124.76,124.9],["the",124.9,125.04],["instruments",125.04,125.46],["was",125.46,125.74],["dominant.",125.74,126.12]]},{"start":126.44,"end":133.36,"text":"Right. We need to talk about attitudes to music practice. The most striking thing here is that","words":[["Right.",126.44,126.76],["We",127.74,128.02],["need",128.02,128.32],["to",128.32,128.6],["talk",128.6,128.8],["about",128.8,129.02],["attitudes",129.02,129.7],["to",129.7,130.04],["music",130.04,130.38],["practice.",130.38,130.94],["The",131.64,131.84],["most",131.84,132.0],["striking",132.0,132.44],["thing",132.44,132.74],["here",132.74,133.04],["is",133.04,133.2],["that",133.2,133.36]]},{"start":133.36,"end":139.28,"text":"even students who you'd expect to practice for hours every day until they get it perfect say","words":[["even",133.36,133.62],["students",133.62,134.12],["who",134.12,134.46],["you'd",134.46,134.6],["expect",134.6,135.04],["to",135.04,135.32],["practice",135.32,135.66],["for",135.66,135.94],["hours",135.94,136.3],["every",136.3,136.64],["day",136.64,137.02],["until",137.02,137.38],["they",137.38,137.72],["get",137.72,137.98],["it",137.98,138.12],["perfect",138.12,138.56],["say",138.56,139.28]]},{"start":139.28,"end":144.3,"text":"it's being terrified of failing that really makes them practice. I know I'm the same.","words":[["it's",139.28,139.56],["being",139.56,139.8],["terrified",139.8,140.36],["of",140.36,140.72],["failing",140.72,141.14],["that",141.14,141.48],["really",141.48,141.9],["makes",141.9,142.26],["them",142.26,142.44],["practice.",142.44,142.82],["I",143.4,143.56],["know",143.56,143.68],["I'm",143.68,143.9],["the",143.9,144.04],["same.",144.04,144.3]]},{"start":144.64,"end":150.62,"text":"Me too. It's interesting what was said about practising alone. Some people preferred that","words":[["Me",144.64,145.0],["too.",145.0,145.3],["It's",146.12,146.38],["interesting",146.38,146.82],["what",146.82,147.04],["was",147.04,147.18],["said",147.18,147.36],["about",147.36,147.58],["practising",147.58,148.18],["alone.",148.18,148.58],["Some",149.3,149.56],["people",149.56,149.86],["preferred",149.86,150.26],["that",150.26,150.62]]},{"start":150.62,"end":155.26,"text":"because they could focus more on their weak points. But that wasn't a majority view.","words":[["because",150.62,151.18],["they",151.18,151.4],["could",151.4,151.52],["focus",151.52,151.8],["more",151.8,152.1],["on",152.1,152.28],["their",152.28,152.42],["weak",152.42,152.62],["points.",152.62,153.06],["But",153.38,153.62],["that",153.62,153.84],["wasn't",153.84,154.26],["a",154.26,154.36],["majority",154.36,154.76],["view.",154.76,155.26]]},{"start":155.98,"end":160.48,"text":"What most of them agree on is that there's nothing more rewarding than mastering something","words":[["What",155.98,156.26],["most",156.26,156.62],["of",156.62,156.82],["them",156.82,156.96],["agree",156.96,157.16],["on",157.16,157.52],["is",157.52,157.78],["that",157.78,157.96],["there's",157.96,158.2],["nothing",158.2,158.48],["more",158.48,158.78],["rewarding",158.78,159.32],["than",159.32,159.54],["mastering",159.54,160.0],["something",160.0,160.48]]},{"start":160.48,"end":166.46,"text":"that's really hard to learn. That's right. Okay, after that we should talk a bit about","words":[["that's",160.48,160.8],["really",160.8,161.14],["hard",161.14,161.46],["to",161.46,161.68],["learn.",161.68,161.98],["That's",162.16,162.44],["right.",162.44,162.7],["Okay,",163.5,164.02],["after",164.5,164.88],["that",164.88,165.18],["we",165.18,165.42],["should",165.42,165.62],["talk",165.62,165.86],["a",165.86,166.04],["bit",166.04,166.16],["about",166.16,166.46]]},{"start":166.46,"end":169.5,"text":"the pieces that students select for assessed performances.","words":[["the",166.46,166.62],["pieces",166.62,166.92],["that",166.92,167.18],["students",167.18,167.52],["select",167.52,167.98],["for",167.98,168.28],["assessed",168.28,168.74],["performances.",168.74,169.5]]},{"start":169.9,"end":175.38,"text":"There wasn't quite so much consensus on this, was there? A few people prefer to do pieces","words":[["There",169.9,170.14],["wasn't",170.14,170.44],["quite",170.44,170.64],["so",170.64,170.88],["much",170.88,171.1],["consensus",171.1,171.6],["on",171.6,171.9],["this,",171.9,172.16],["was",172.26,172.34],["there?",172.34,172.66],["A",173.4,173.54],["few",173.54,173.86],["people",173.86,174.24],["prefer",174.24,174.6],["to",174.6,174.9],["do",174.9,175.0],["pieces",175.0,175.38]]},{"start":175.38,"end":180.08,"text":"which are relatively unknown, while others choose the ones they think will show off their","words":[["which",175.38,175.62],["are",175.62,175.76],["relatively",175.76,176.16],["unknown,",176.16,176.86],["while",177.1,177.5],["others",177.5,177.92],["choose",177.92,178.4],["the",178.4,178.62],["ones",178.62,178.84],["they",178.84,179.04],["think",179.04,179.32],["will",179.32,179.5],["show",179.5,179.72],["off",179.72,179.92],["their",179.92,180.08]]},{"start":180.08,"end":183.06,"text":"technical ability. But they were in the minority.","words":[["technical",180.08,180.46],["ability.",180.46,180.96],["But",181.54,181.84],["they",181.84,182.14],["were",182.14,182.3],["in",182.3,182.42],["the",182.42,182.52],["minority.",182.52,183.06]]},{"start":183.44,"end":188.44,"text":"I think the first thing to say is that a high percentage said they would always try","words":[["I",183.44,183.74],["think",183.74,184.66],["the",184.66,184.8],["first",184.8,185.04],["thing",185.04,185.26],["to",185.26,185.42],["say",185.42,185.74],["is",185.74,186.02],["that",186.02,186.16],["a",186.16,186.24],["high",186.24,186.44],["percentage",186.44,187.0],["said",187.0,187.56],["they",187.56,187.8],["would",187.8,187.96],["always",187.96,188.2],["try",188.2,188.44]]},{"start":188.44,"end":192.84,"text":"to learn their pieces by heart, because it's too easy to get lost if you're trying to","words":[["to",188.44,188.6],["learn",188.6,188.86],["their",188.86,189.06],["pieces",189.06,189.34],["by",189.34,189.64],["heart,",189.64,190.16],["because",190.42,190.82],["it's",190.82,191.08],["too",191.08,191.22],["easy",191.22,191.46],["to",191.46,191.64],["get",191.64,191.8],["lost",191.8,192.12],["if",192.12,192.32],["you're",192.32,192.48],["trying",192.48,192.68],["to",192.68,192.84]]},{"start":192.84,"end":194.54,"text":"read and play when you're nervous.","words":[["read",192.84,193.12],["and",193.12,193.44],["play",193.44,193.82],["when",193.82,194.04],["you're",194.04,194.22],["nervous.",194.22,194.54]]},{"start":194.54,"end":200.76,"text":"Okay. And quite a lot of them said it helps to listen to other people playing your chosen","words":[["Okay.",194.54,195.32],["And",196.14,196.66],["quite",196.66,197.0],["a",197.0,197.24],["lot",197.24,197.44],["of",197.44,197.6],["them",197.6,197.74],["said",197.74,198.0],["it",198.0,198.16],["helps",198.16,198.42],["to",198.42,198.68],["listen",198.68,198.94],["to",198.94,199.16],["other",199.16,199.4],["people",199.4,199.72],["playing",199.72,200.1],["your",200.1,200.36],["chosen",200.36,200.76]]},{"start":200.76,"end":204.9,"text":"piece, preferably recordings but even just other students.","words":[["piece,",200.76,201.12],["preferably",201.52,202.02],["recordings",202.02,202.66],["but",202.66,203.26],["even",203.26,203.82],["just",203.82,204.22],["other",204.22,204.48],["students.",204.48,204.9]]},{"start":208.56,"end":214.06,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 27","words":[["Before",208.56,209.06],["you",209.06,209.34],["hear",209.34,209.62],["the",209.62,209.84],["rest",209.84,210.08],["of",210.08,210.22],["the",210.22,210.3],["discussion,",210.3,210.76],["you",211.36,211.58],["have",211.58,211.76],["some",211.76,211.92],["time",211.92,212.38],["to",212.38,212.62],["look",212.62,212.74],["at",212.74,212.86],["questions",212.86,213.18],["27",213.18,214.06]]},{"start":214.06,"end":238.48,"text":"to 30. Now listen and answer questions 27 to 30.","words":[["to",214.06,214.3],["30.",214.3,214.64],["Now",235.04,235.38],["listen",235.38,235.7],["and",235.7,236.1],["answer",236.1,236.5],["questions",236.5,236.94],["27",236.94,237.86],["to",237.86,238.12],["30.",238.12,238.48]]},{"start":241.94,"end":247.82,"text":"So finally we need to look at the findings for students' attitudes to performing. We","words":[["So",241.94,242.44],["finally",242.44,243.0],["we",243.0,243.54],["need",243.54,243.76],["to",243.76,243.94],["look",243.94,244.1],["at",244.1,244.24],["the",244.24,244.34],["findings",244.34,244.68],["for",244.68,245.02],["students'",245.02,245.32],["attitudes",245.56,245.96],["to",245.96,246.28],["performing.",246.28,246.78],["We",247.46,247.82]]},{"start":247.82,"end":253.34,"text":"should point out that this includes informal and formal public performances as well as","words":[["should",247.82,248.1],["point",248.1,248.38],["out",248.38,248.76],["that",248.76,248.96],["this",248.96,249.16],["includes",249.16,249.62],["informal",249.62,250.26],["and",250.26,250.68],["formal",250.68,251.1],["public",251.1,251.52],["performances",251.52,252.16],["as",252.16,252.74],["well",252.74,253.18],["as",253.18,253.34]]},{"start":253.34,"end":254.02,"text":"assessed ones.","words":[["assessed",253.34,253.66],["ones.",253.66,254.02]]},{"start":254.38,"end":259.96,"text":"Yes, that's important. I expected to find that performing solo would make students","words":[["Yes,",254.38,254.66],["that's",254.98,255.22],["important.",255.22,255.68],["I",256.74,256.92],["expected",256.92,257.38],["to",257.38,257.64],["find",257.64,257.88],["that",257.88,258.04],["performing",258.04,258.38],["solo",258.38,258.94],["would",258.94,259.26],["make",259.26,259.52],["students",259.52,259.96]]},{"start":259.96,"end":262.7,"text":"very nervous, but in fact that isn't the case.","words":[["very",259.96,260.4],["nervous,",260.4,260.84],["but",261.2,261.44],["in",261.44,261.56],["fact",261.56,261.84],["that",261.84,262.02],["isn't",262.02,262.32],["the",262.32,262.4],["case.",262.4,262.7]]},{"start":263.14,"end":267.72,"text":"They do find it hugely challenging to start with, but they appreciate the challenge","words":[["They",263.14,263.4],["do",263.4,263.62],["find",263.62,263.9],["it",263.9,264.02],["hugely",264.02,264.34],["challenging",264.34,264.94],["to",264.94,265.2],["start",265.2,265.46],["with,",265.46,265.76],["but",266.22,266.42],["they",266.42,266.64],["appreciate",266.64,267.1],["the",267.1,267.36],["challenge",267.36,267.72]]},{"start":267.72,"end":268.84,"text":"and find it stimulating.","words":[["and",267.72,267.98],["find",267.98,268.24],["it",268.24,268.42],["stimulating.",268.42,268.84]]},{"start":269.5,"end":274.66,"text":"Right. I was surprised by what students said about deciding which pieces to perform.","words":[["Right.",269.5,269.86],["I",270.84,271.06],["was",271.06,271.16],["surprised",271.16,271.48],["by",271.48,271.72],["what",271.72,271.86],["students",271.86,272.18],["said",272.18,272.54],["about",272.54,272.76],["deciding",272.76,273.38],["which",273.38,273.72],["pieces",273.72,274.04],["to",274.04,274.28],["perform.",274.28,274.66]]},{"start":274.66,"end":279.34,"text":"form. I thought they'd all say this was easy. For me, it's always been quite straightforward.","words":[["form.",274.66,274.82],["I",275.26,275.56],["thought",275.56,275.72],["they'd",275.72,275.9],["all",275.9,276.0],["say",276.0,276.24],["this",276.24,276.42],["was",276.42,276.54],["easy.",276.54,276.9],["For",277.46,277.62],["me,",277.62,277.76],["it's",277.86,278.0],["always",278.0,278.24],["been",278.24,278.52],["quite",278.52,278.82],["straightforward.",278.82,279.34]]},{"start":279.96,"end":285.68,"text":"Which pieces do I like best? And which pieces can I play well? And my repertoire is quite","words":[["Which",279.96,280.22],["pieces",280.22,280.58],["do",280.58,280.84],["I",280.84,280.94],["like",280.94,281.18],["best?",281.18,281.56],["And",282.12,282.26],["which",282.26,282.42],["pieces",282.42,282.78],["can",282.78,282.98],["I",282.98,283.1],["play",283.1,283.34],["well?",283.34,283.66],["And",284.28,284.54],["my",284.54,284.76],["repertoire",284.76,285.14],["is",285.14,285.48],["quite",285.48,285.68]]},{"start":285.68,"end":290.38,"text":"limited anyway. But the most commonly cited answer was that it took them ages to make","words":[["limited",285.68,286.08],["anyway.",286.08,286.46],["But",287.04,287.2],["the",287.2,287.3],["most",287.3,287.5],["commonly",287.5,287.96],["cited",287.96,288.36],["answer",288.36,288.82],["was",288.82,289.04],["that",289.04,289.22],["it",289.22,289.4],["took",289.4,289.54],["them",289.54,289.7],["ages",289.7,290.0],["to",290.0,290.24],["make",290.24,290.38]]},{"start":290.38,"end":291.14,"text":"their minds up.","words":[["their",290.38,290.54],["minds",290.54,290.82],["up.",290.82,291.14]]},{"start":291.36,"end":296.54,"text":"I suppose it's because there are so many factors involved. You need to consider your","words":[["I",291.36,291.52],["suppose",291.52,291.92],["it's",291.92,292.22],["because",292.22,292.44],["there",292.44,292.64],["are",292.64,292.74],["so",292.74,293.04],["many",293.04,293.32],["factors",293.32,293.8],["involved.",293.8,294.32],["You",295.08,295.46],["need",295.46,295.68],["to",295.68,295.84],["consider",295.84,296.28],["your",296.28,296.54]]},{"start":296.54,"end":301.98,"text":"audience, the venue, the time available to learn the piece, especially if it's complicated.","words":[["audience,",296.54,297.16],["the",297.54,297.64],["venue,",297.64,298.04],["the",298.54,298.7],["time",298.7,299.0],["available",299.0,299.26],["to",299.26,299.64],["learn",299.64,299.92],["the",299.92,300.12],["piece,",300.12,300.6],["especially",300.74,301.14],["if",301.14,301.38],["it's",301.38,301.56],["complicated.",301.56,301.98]]},{"start":301.98,"end":306.86,"text":"You need to think about all these things, and you can't do that in a hurry.","words":[["You",301.98,302.54],["need",302.54,303.32],["to",303.32,303.5],["think",303.5,303.68],["about",303.68,303.88],["all",303.88,304.28],["these",304.28,304.52],["things,",304.52,304.98],["and",305.16,305.54],["you",305.54,305.68],["can't",305.68,306.04],["do",306.04,306.16],["that",306.16,306.36],["in",306.36,306.52],["a",306.52,306.6],["hurry.",306.6,306.86]]},{"start":307.38,"end":307.96,"text":"That's true.","words":[["That's",307.38,307.64],["true.",307.64,307.96]]},{"start":308.54,"end":316.18,"text":"Then there's performing with musicians from a different genre, like a classical musician playing with a jazz group. That can really be fun.","words":[["Then",308.54,308.96],["there's",308.96,309.32],["performing",309.32,309.7],["with",309.7,310.06],["musicians",310.06,310.46],["from",310.46,310.76],["a",310.76,310.92],["different",310.92,311.14],["genre,",311.14,311.6],["like",311.8,312.14],["a",312.14,312.34],["classical",312.34,312.78],["musician",312.78,313.42],["playing",313.42,313.94],["with",313.94,314.14],["a",314.14,314.26],["jazz",314.26,314.48],["group.",314.48,314.76],["That",315.1,315.3],["can",315.3,315.46],["really",315.46,315.68],["be",315.68,315.86],["fun.",315.86,316.18]]},{"start":316.72,"end":320.06,"text":"But most of the music students had never even considered it.","words":[["But",316.72,316.94],["most",316.94,317.26],["of",317.26,317.42],["the",317.42,317.52],["music",317.52,317.76],["students",317.76,318.28],["had",318.28,318.7],["never",318.7,319.0],["even",319.0,319.22],["considered",319.22,319.78],["it.",319.78,320.06]]},{"start":320.22,"end":326.62,"text":"Right. For performing with musicians who play the same instrument, almost everyone put the same thing.","words":[["Right.",320.22,320.56],["For",321.42,321.62],["performing",321.62,322.06],["with",322.06,322.34],["musicians",322.34,322.82],["who",322.82,323.22],["play",323.22,323.5],["the",323.5,323.66],["same",323.66,323.92],["instrument,",323.92,324.42],["almost",324.66,324.9],["everyone",324.9,325.58],["put",325.58,325.94],["the",325.94,326.08],["same",326.08,326.34],["thing.",326.34,326.62]]},{"start":326.62,"end":332.54,"text":"Yes, they all said it was incredibly helpful, and not at all intimidating, which says a","words":[["Yes,",326.62,327.06],["they",327.48,327.68],["all",327.68,327.86],["said",327.86,328.1],["it",328.1,328.28],["was",328.28,328.4],["incredibly",328.4,328.84],["helpful,",328.84,329.44],["and",330.06,330.26],["not",330.26,330.4],["at",330.4,330.52],["all",330.52,330.76],["intimidating,",330.76,331.38],["which",331.96,332.16],["says",332.16,332.4],["a",332.4,332.54]]},{"start":332.54,"end":334.02,"text":"lot for the department's ethos.","words":[["lot",332.54,332.74],["for",332.74,332.94],["the",332.94,333.02],["department's",333.02,333.6],["ethos.",333.6,334.02]]},{"start":334.14,"end":335.42,"text":"Yes, that's a good point.","words":[["Yes,",334.14,334.48],["that's",334.74,334.96],["a",334.96,335.04],["good",335.04,335.16],["point.",335.16,335.42]]},{"start":336.04,"end":339.4,"text":"Okay, what I think we should sort out now...","words":[["Okay,",336.04,336.52],["what",337.0,337.4],["I",337.4,337.7],["think",337.7,337.94],["we",337.94,338.1],["should",338.1,338.24],["sort",338.24,338.44],["out",338.44,338.68],["now...",338.68,339.4]]},{"start":342.7,"end":344.48,"text":"That is the end of Part 3.","words":[["That",342.7,343.06],["is",343.06,343.2],["the",343.2,343.36],["end",343.36,343.72],["of",343.72,343.88],["Part",343.88,344.08],["3.",344.08,344.48]]},{"start":345.28,"end":348.96,"text":"You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to Part 3.","words":[["You",345.28,345.48],["now",345.48,345.72],["have",345.72,346.02],["30",346.02,346.38],["seconds",346.38,346.8],["to",346.8,347.12],["check",347.12,347.42],["your",347.42,347.62],["answers",347.62,348.04],["to",348.04,348.32],["Part",348.32,348.54],["3.",348.54,348.96]]}]}